# game/script.rpy:1049
translate english next_1765a5e6:

    # nvle "Helena se sienta sobre una piedra húmeda. Apoya la caja metálica en sus rodillas. La observa como si pesara una tonelada. No la abre. Solo la mira."
    nvle "Helena sits on a damp stone. She rests the metal box on her knees. She stares at it as if it weighed a ton. She doesn't open it. She just stares at it."

# game/script.rpy:1050
translate english next_beaef817:

    # nvle "Y entonces, rompe en llanto."
    nvle "And then, he bursts into tears."

# game/script.rpy:1051
translate english next_4f3728ae:
    # nvle "No un llanto de pánico. No uno histérico, sino uno lento, contenido. De agotamiento. De duelo. De estar perdiéndose. Chancho se le acerca. No dice nada."
    nvle "Not a panic cry. Not a hysterical one, but a slow, contained one. Of exhaustion. Of grief. Of being lost. Chancho approaches. He says nothing."

    # nvle "Chancho saca de su bolsillo una flor aplastada —una caléndula medio deshecha, embarrada— y se la ofrece. Es un gesto torpe, infantil, pero sincero."
    nvle "Chancho pulls from his pocket a crushed flower —a half-destroyed, muddy marigold— and offers it. It’s a clumsy, childlike gesture, but sincere."

    # nvle "Helena la toma con manos temblorosas."
    nvle "Helena takes it with trembling hands."

    # voice "Helena_104.mp3"
    # he "Lo único que tengo claro... es que si la encuentro, quiero que esté viva. Y si no... quiero saber por qué."
    voice "Helena_104.mp3"
    he "The only thing I know for sure... is that if I find her, I want her to be alive. And if not... I want to know why."

    # ad "Entonces eso haremos. Buscar respuestas. Aunque duelan."
    ad "Then that’s what we’ll do. Search for answers. Even if they hurt."

    # nvle "Por ahora, han decidido seguir, pero la duda sobre su madre, sobre Chancho, sobre sí misma, se ha vuelto una semilla viva en su interior. Y está creciendo."
    nvle "For now, they’ve decided to keep going, but the doubt about her mother, about Chancho, about herself, has become a living seed inside her. And it’s growing."

    # nvle "Una pequeña fogata se ha extinguido hace rato."
    nvle "A small campfire has been out for a while."

    # nvle "Adara duerme recostada cerca de la fogata. Chancho reposa hecho bolita a sus pies. Helena se ha sentado cerca, con la caja metálica entre las piernas. La mira en silencio."
    nvle "Adara sleeps lying next to the fire. Chancho is curled up at her feet. Helena is sitting nearby, with the metal box between her legs. She stares at it in silence."

    # nvle "El sueño llega sin permiso."
    nvle "Sleep comes without permission."

    # hu "Sé una buena niña... solo un bocado más."
    hu "Be a good girl... just one more bite."

    # voice "Nina_22.mp3" 
    # he "¿Dónde estás?"
    voice "Nina_22.mp3" 
    he "Where are you?"

    # nvle "Helena se despierta de golpe. Jadea, se lleva una mano a la boca. Está cubierta de sudor."
    nvle "Helena wakes up suddenly. She gasps, puts a hand over her mouth. She’s covered in sweat."

    # nvle "Adara se ha despertado también. La observa, sin decir nada. Solo se acerca. Se sienta a su lado, en silencio. Helena apoya la cabeza en su hombro. Adara no la aparta."
    nvle "Adara has woken up too. She watches her without saying a word. She just approaches. She sits next to her, in silence. Helena rests her head on her shoulder. Adara doesn’t move away."

    # ad "¿Fue muy feo?"
    ad "Was it very bad?"

    # nvle "Helena asiente con un leve movimiento."
    nvle "Helena nods slightly."

    # voice "Helena_106.mp3"
    # he "No la encontraba. Comía y comía... pero ella no estaba."
    voice "Helena_106.mp3"
    he "I couldn’t find her. I kept eating and eating... but she wasn’t there."
